"монтажного стола"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, useful information, insert, "
"overwrite, advanced, timeline, editing, documentation, user manual, video "
